  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">"This book deals with the relationship between violence, oppression, silence, and power structures. Illustrations of Power plays with glossy and handmade textures. The transparent quality of the book allows the reader to float through and between the ideas and images, to experience the intimacy of the pictures and words separately and then correlate the physical transparency of the book with the story." -- Women's Studio Workshop website, accessed 4/21/2012.</subfield>
